===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[genre]] of [[music]] of [[Indonesian]] origin typically featuring [[metallophone]]s, [[xylophone]]s, [[drum]]s, [[gong]]s and a [[bamboo flute]] (called a [[siuling]]).
# The name of the [[ensemble]] performing this style of music.

